{"2189310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Letters to Arralla", "steam_appid": 2189310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4012800], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/7576d0906465dc02320e687410b47bc3.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/7576d0906465dc02320e687410b47bc3.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=182 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a turnip with a big juicy bum delivering mail to a cast of colourful characters on the sunny island of Arralla!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/31945e4b300184f3872bdc6be0888176.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/31945e4b300184f3872bdc6be0888176.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best part of delivering mail? You can open every single letter and look through everyone’s business! Whilst in the real world this is a crime, on Arralla Isle it’s perfectly acceptable, and even encouraged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/f7a282fda82066d13b4accfa8efaf0d7.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/f7a282fda82066d13b4accfa8efaf0d7.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Arralla Isle Deliberry service, you'll have to solve where each letter goes through pictograms drawn on each envelope - and they're not always obvious! &gt;:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/65282b356e26b26966e39731485c6678.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/65282b356e26b26966e39731485c6678.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn of the island residents’ interpersonal problems through reading their mail - they will need your help to resolve them! Meet big booty cutie fruits like grouchy glassblowers, silly scientists, and deliver seriously creepy letters to an ominous house on a hill…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/b84dc0bbd4477cee29151e99e756a301.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/b84dc0bbd4477cee29151e99e756a301.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Arralla Isle, there’s no rush. The pace is slow, like a lazy summer day, so you can relax while you play. Exploration is a treat in this beautiful Australian landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/e66c25ed25aaf6de2551aa8ca778cf7f.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/e66c25ed25aaf6de2551aa8ca778cf7f.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap photos, kick over chessboard pieces, read about Arralla Isle’s history, throw stuff, discover secrets. The island is your oyster. You can even call your mum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s plenty to do as a mail delivery turnip on Arralla Isle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/293b7d9cab2c60c9010cfe9ed441d91c.avif?t=1766014614\" width=610 height=75 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/7576d0906465dc02320e687410b47bc3.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/7576d0906465dc02320e687410b47bc3.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=182 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a turnip with a big juicy bum delivering mail to a cast of colourful characters on the sunny island of Arralla!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/31945e4b300184f3872bdc6be0888176.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/31945e4b300184f3872bdc6be0888176.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best part of delivering mail? You can open every single letter and look through everyone’s business! Whilst in the real world this is a crime, on Arralla Isle it’s perfectly acceptable, and even encouraged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/f7a282fda82066d13b4accfa8efaf0d7.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/f7a282fda82066d13b4accfa8efaf0d7.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Arralla Isle Deliberry service, you'll have to solve where each letter goes through pictograms drawn on each envelope - and they're not always obvious! &gt;:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/65282b356e26b26966e39731485c6678.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/65282b356e26b26966e39731485c6678.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn of the island residents’ interpersonal problems through reading their mail - they will need your help to resolve them! Meet big booty cutie fruits like grouchy glassblowers, silly scientists, and deliver seriously creepy letters to an ominous house on a hill…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/b84dc0bbd4477cee29151e99e756a301.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/b84dc0bbd4477cee29151e99e756a301.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Arralla Isle, there’s no rush. The pace is slow, like a lazy summer day, so you can relax while you play. Exploration is a treat in this beautiful Australian landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/e66c25ed25aaf6de2551aa8ca778cf7f.avif?t=1766014614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras_big/e66c25ed25aaf6de2551aa8ca778cf7f.avif?t=1766014614 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap photos, kick over chessboard pieces, read about Arralla Isle’s history, throw stuff, discover secrets. The island is your oyster. You can even call your mum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s plenty to do as a mail delivery turnip on Arralla Isle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/extras/293b7d9cab2c60c9010cfe9ed441d91c.avif?t=1766014614\" width=610 height=75 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Play as a turnip with a big juicy bum delivering mail to a cast of colourful characters on an Australian island. Get the mail where it needs to go by reading residents’ letters, solving puzzles, and exploring the island’s sun-soaked beaches.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/header.jpg?t=1766014614", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/bf79cbc726020c6ccc95c0f2c018f0b0e00e758d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766014614", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2189310/bf79cbc726020c6ccc95c0f2c018f0b0e00e758d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766014614", "website": "https://www.littlepinkclouds.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 Home or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6200 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> At least 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 940MX or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 Home or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6200 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> At least 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 940MX or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Little Pink Cloud